  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The task ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2671"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2671",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " will remove the pairtree node creation by default.  However we need a way to restore the old pairtree generating behavior for those folks who depend on it.   The task then is to define a system property ( e.g. fcrepo.pairtree.generate) that when set to true will restore pairtree generation on new nodes.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
