  "description": "<p>The task <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2671\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2671</a> will remove the pairtree node creation by default.  However we need a way to restore the old pairtree generating behavior for those folks who depend on it.   The task then is to define a system property ( e.g. fcrepo.pairtree.generate) that when set to true will restore pairtree generation on new nodes.</p>",
